<div class="ipq-title"><h1>Purchase Requests</h1><p>Raw Material Low Stock စာရင်း · Main Warehouse</p></div>
<% if(purchaseQueue.sent){ %><p class="ipq-success" role="status">Purchaser ရဲ့ Purchase Requisition စာရင်းတွင် <strong><%= purchaseQueue.sent.request_no %></strong> ရှိပါပြီ။</p><% } %><% if(purchaseQueue.error){ %><p class="ipq-error" role="alert"><%= purchaseQueue.error %></p><% } %>
<section class="ipq-card"><header class="ipq-heading"><span class="ipq-bell"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9M9 21h6M3 3 1 6m20-3 2 3"/></svg></span><div><h2>Low Stock Auto-Reorder Queue</h2><p>Closing Stock ≤ Reorder Qty ဖြစ်သော Raw Material များကို အလိုအလျောက် ပြထားပါသည်။</p></div><b><%= purchaseQueue.materials.length %> items</b></header>
<div class="ipq-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Material &amp; Item Code</th><th>Current Stock</th><th>Reorder Point</th><th>Status</th><th>Order Qty</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const m of purchaseQueue.materials){ %><tr><td><strong><%= m.name %></strong><small><%= m.code %></small><small><%= m.category %></small></td><td><b class="ipq-stock"><%= Number(m.stock_qty).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:3}) %></b> <%= m.unit %></td><td><%= Number(m.reorder_qty).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:3}) %> <%= m.unit %></td><td><span class="ipq-status">Low Stock</span></td><td><form id="ipq-request-<%= m.id %>" method="post" action="/inventory/purchase-requests/request" class="ipq-order"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="material_id" value="<%= m.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="request_key" value="<%= m.request_key %>"><input name="qty" type="number" min="<%= m.unit==='pcs'?'1':'0.001' %>" step="<%= m.unit==='pcs'?'1':'0.001' %>" max="999999999.999" placeholder="Qty" aria-label="Order Qty for <%= m.code %>" value="<%= m.pending?m.pending.qty:String(purchaseQueue.values.material_id||'')===String(m.id)?purchaseQueue.values.qty||'':'' %>" <%= m.pending?'readonly':'required' %>><span><%= m.unit %></span></form></td><td><% if(m.pending){ %><span class="ipq-sent">✓ PR Sent</span><a class="ipq-pr-link" href="/inventory/purchase-requests/pr/<%= m.pending.id %>"><%= m.pending.request_no %></a><% }else{ %><button type="submit" form="ipq-request-<%= m.id %>" class="ipq-request"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 11 18-8-8 18-3-8zM10 13 21 3"/></svg>Request to Purchaser</button><% } %></td></tr><% } %><% if(!purchaseQueue.materials.length){ %><tr><td colspan="6" class="ipq-empty">Low Stock ဖြစ်သော Raw Material မရှိသေးပါ။</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div>
<footer class="ipq-foot">Quantity ဖြည့်ပြီး Request to Purchaser နှိပ်လျှင် Purchase Requisition စာရင်းသို့ ပို့ပေးမည်။</footer></section>
